      <title>Anthropic IPO: Silicon Valley’s AI Bets Are Built on Hype, Hope and Hubris</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-11-02/anthropic-ipo-silicon-valley-s-ai-bets-are-built-on-hype-hope-and-hubris</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">28e073ebe010146b40b7be35</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 05:00:07 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Faith has propelled several technology revolutions. No one had hard evidence that personal computers, the Internet or social networks would create digital economies worth billions of dollars, but the perseverance of visionaries like Steve Jobs, Jeff Bezos and Mark Zuckerberg made it happen. Now the tech industry faces mounting skepticism about its ability to repeat the trick with artificial intelligence.</description>
