    <item>
      <title>Republican Midterm Redistricting Now Looks Like a Blunder</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-11-01/republican-midterm-redistricting-now-looks-like-a-blunder</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">fc5dd97ca5cb17f61bfd1c41</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 13:00:02 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>President Donald Trump’s mid-decade redistricting war is shaping up to be a strategic blunder. At the president’s urging, Republicans gerrymandered new maps based on Trump’s 2024 performance, wrongly assuming the midterm electorate would match his presidential coalition. Now, once-durable Republican strongholds that were redrawn for partisan gain have become fragile, forcing Republicans to direct resources to districts they thought would be solidly red.</description>
      <dc:creator>Mary Ellen Klas</dc:creator>
